vla-maker-from-cbd — derivative models of NVIDIA Isaac GR00T N1.7
==================================================================

This repository distributes the following derivative models of NVIDIA GR00T N1.7
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B):

  checkpoint-47000/                 GR00T N1.7-3B with its action head fine-tuned on Common Behavior Data
                                    derived from HumanML3D. The vision-language backbone (NVIDIA Cosmos-Reason2-2B)
                                    was frozen during training and is unchanged from GR00T N1.7.
  action_heads/arm_H.safetensors    An action head further fine-tuned from checkpoint-47000.

